{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a singleprofile RNA-only setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5203 and F1 of 0.4982. These results suggest the scvi_n200 encoder outperforms the pca_n2000 baseline in singleprofile settings, but the exact contribution of the encoder versus profile-specific factors remains uncertain. The performance gap compared to multiprofile scvi_n200 (config_005) indicates potential profile-setting dependencies, though further experiments are needed to isolate this effect."
}

